{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017WG8YjpSKXMHU86wjV5Xi9","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '核心 detection claim 不成立。控制实验显示 SFT 泛化效应完全掩盖 Δlz* 信号：15% 污染的 Cohen''s\n2\t  d < 0.3， AUROC 接近 chance。50% 以下污染在所有 benchmark 均不可靠检测。必须 reframe 为 negative result\n3\t  paper： (1) 建立 binary-response detection 的 information-theoretic lower bound， (2)\n4\t  将 universal model misfit 升级为独立 finding 并在 13K-model scale 刻画， (3) detection frontier\n5\t  taxonomy 整合现有方法定位 IRT-FIT 的位置。 叙事核心转为 \"we tried the theoretically principled approach\n6\t  at the minimal-information operating point, proved it cannot work under real SFT\n7\t  conditions, and explain exactly why — this is a warning to the community that binary-only\n8\t  detection has a hard floor.\"\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)\n13\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n14\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B 上用 QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/15%/50% MMLU items，测量 Δlz*。 3 independent\n15\t    runs per level 以估计 run-to-run variance。 这是整篇论文的 go/no-go gate。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    n_runs_per_level: 3\n20\t    clean_sft_lz_star_mean: -18.4\n21\t    clean_sft_lz_star_std_across_runs: 3.2\n22\t    clean_sft_accuracy_mmlu: 0.637\n23\t    clean_sft_theta: 0.41\n24\t    contam_15pct_lz_star_mean: -17.1\n25\t    contam_15pct_lz_star_std_across_runs: 3.8\n26\t    contam_15pct_accuracy_mmlu: 0.661\n27\t    contam_15pct_theta: 0.48\n28\t    delta_lz_star_15pct_mean: 1.3\n29\t    delta_lz_star_15pct_cohen_d: 0.22\n30\t    delta_lz_star_15pct_p_value: 0.38\n31\t    contam_50pct_lz_star_mean: -14.6\n32\t    contam_50pct_lz_star_std_across_runs: 4.1\n33\t    contam_50pct_accuracy_mmlu: 0.712\n34\t    contam_50pct_theta: 0.62\n35\t    delta_lz_star_50pct_mean: 3.8\n36\t    delta_lz_star_50pct_cohen_d: 0.55\n37\t    delta_lz_star_50pct_p_value: 0.11\n38\t    go_no_go_verdict: NO-GO for original detection claim\n39\t  result_rationale: 'SFT 泛化效应是 worst 档的核心机制。即使只注入 15% MMLU items，QLoRA SFT 也带来全局知识能力提升\n40\t    （accuracy +2.4pp），因为 MMLU 涵盖广泛学科知识，SFT on MMLU items 等价于 knowledge distillation。\n41\t    这种全局能力提升使 θ 整体上移，而 θ 上移后模型在所有 item 上的表现都更好——包括未污染的 85% items。 结果是 lz* 的变化反映的不是\n42\t    \"aberrant response pattern\"（答对不该答对的题）， 而是 \"uniformly better response pattern\"（所有题都答得更好），后者在\n43\t    person-fit 框架下是正常的高能力表现。 Run-to-run variance 来自 QLoRA 的随机初始化和 batch ordering，在小\n44\t    epoch SFT 下显著（std ~3.5）。 15% 的 Δlz*=1.3 完全淹没在 run-to-run noise 中（Cohen''s d=0.22,\n45\t    p=0.38）。 50% 时 Δlz*=3.8 略大但仍不显著（d=0.55, p=0.11），因为 50% 污染同时带来更大的泛化效应。 关键洞察：simulation\n46\t    之所以 power=97.9% 是因为 simulation 中污染只改变被污染 items 的 response， 不改变未污染 items——即 no\n47\t    generalization。Real SFT 打破了这个假设。\n48\t\n49\t    '\n50\t  tables:\n51\t  - name: 'Table: Pilot Δlz* Results (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)'\n52\t    columns:\n53\t    - Contam Level\n54\t    - Accuracy\n55\t    - θ\n56\t    - lz* (mean±std)\n57\t    - Δlz*\n58\t    - Cohen's d\n59\t    - p-value\n60\t    rows:\n61\t    - - 0% (clean SFT)\n62\t      - '0.637'\n63\t      - '0.41'\n64\t      - -18.4 ± 3.2\n65\t      - —\n66\t      - —\n67\t      - —\n68\t    - - 15%\n69\t      - '0.661'\n70\t      - '0.48'\n71\t      - -17.1 ± 3.8\n72\t      - '+1.3'\n73\t      - '0.22'\n74\t      - '0.38'\n75\t    - - 50%\n76\t      - '0.712'\n77\t      - '0.62'\n78\t      - -14.6 ± 4.1\n79\t      - '+3.8'\n80\t      - '0.55'\n81\t      - '0.11'\n82\t  figures_description:\n83\t  - 'Fig: Δlz* distribution across 3 runs per level, with overlapping violin plots\n84\t    showing 0%/15%/50%. 15% 和 0% 的分布几乎完全重叠，50% 略有偏移但仍有大量 overlap。附 simulation 预测 Δlz*\n85\t    作为 dashed line 对比，显示 simulation-reality gap。'\n86\t  analysis: 'Pilot 结果明确：原始 detection claim 不成立。Simulation 预测 15% 污染应有 Δlz* ≈ -8.5（向负方向），\n87\t    实际只有 +1.3（甚至方向都不对——因为泛化使 θ 升高，lz* 向正方向移动而非负方向）。 这是 fundamental information bottleneck：binary\n88\t    responses 无法区分 \"learned the specific items\" 和 \"learned the underlying knowledge\"。必须\n89\t    pivot 到 negative result framing。 但这个 negative result 本身有价值：它证明 SFT contamination\n90\t    at ≤15% 在 binary-only operating point 是 fundamentally undetectable，不是方法不够好而是信息不够。\n91\t\n92\t    '\n93\t- name: Full Controlled Contamination Experiment\n94\t  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n95\t  description: '4 模型 × 6 contamination levels × 3 benchmarks 的完整控制实验。 建立 ground-truth\n96\t    contamination → Δlz* 映射全谱。\n97\t\n98\t    '\n99\t  expected_results:\n100\t    n_models: 4\n101\t    models:\n102\t    - Qwen3.5-9B\n103\t    - Gemma-4-31B\n104\t    - Llama-3.1-8B\n105\t    - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n106\t    n_levels: 6\n107\t    levels:\n108\t    - 0\n109\t    - 5\n110\t    - 10\n111\t    - 15\n112\t    - 25\n113\t    - 50\n114\t    n_benchmarks: 3\n115\t    benchmarks:\n116\t    - MMLU\n117\t    - GSM8K\n118\t    - HellaSwag\n119\t    n_runs_per_cell: 3\n120\t    delta_lz_cohen_d_mmlu:\n121\t      5pct: 0.05\n122\t      10pct: 0.12\n123\t      15pct: 0.24\n124\t      25pct: 0.38\n125\t      50pct: 0.58\n126\t    delta_lz_cohen_d_gsm8k:\n127\t      5pct: 0.02\n128\t      10pct: 0.08\n129\t      15pct: 0.14\n130\t      25pct: 0.22\n131\t      50pct: 0.41\n132\t    delta_lz_cohen_d_hellaswag:\n133\t      5pct: 0.04\n134\t      10pct: 0.1\n135\t      15pct: 0.18\n136\t      25pct: 0.3\n137\t      50pct: 0.48\n138\t    ctrl_auroc_mmlu:\n139\t      5pct: 0.52\n140\t      10pct: 0.56\n141\t      15pct: 0.61\n142\t      25pct: 0.68\n143\t      50pct: 0.78\n144\t    ctrl_auroc_gsm8k:\n145\t      5pct: 0.5\n146\t      10pct: 0.53\n147\t      15pct: 0.55\n148\t      25pct: 0.6\n149\t      50pct: 0.69\n150\t    ctrl_auroc_hellaswag:\n151\t      5pct: 0.51\n152\t      10pct: 0.55\n153\t      15pct: 0.58\n154\t      25pct: 0.64\n155\t      50pct: 0.73\n156\t    delta_lz_cross_model_cv_15pct_mmlu: 0.85\n157\t    delta_lz_cross_model_cv_15pct_gsm8k: 1.12\n158\t    min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct: 55\n159\t    min_detectable_contam_gsm8k_pct: 80\n160\t    min_detectable_contam_hellaswag_pct: 65\n161\t    accuracy_gain_per_pct_contam_mmlu: 0.0016\n162\t    accuracy_gain_per_pct_contam_gsm8k: 0.0021\n163\t    accuracy_gain_clean_sft_vs_base_mmlu: 0.035\n164\t    theta_shift_clean_sft_vs_base_mmlu: 0.15\n165\t    ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_25pct: 0.08\n166\t    ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_50pct: 0.22\n167\t  result_rationale: '四个模型的行为模式一致但 magnitude 差异大（CV=0.85-1.12），验证了 worst 档假设 \"run-to-run\n168\t    variance 太大\"。 核心原因：(1) SFT 泛化：每 1% MMLU 污染带来 0.16pp accuracy 提升，但其中大部分来自知识泛化而非\n169\t    item 记忆。 Clean SFT（0% benchmark items）本身就提升 accuracy 3.5pp，说明 SFT format 本身就改善测试表现。\n170\t    (2) Binary response 信息瓶颈：即使模型确实记住了特定 items，binary correct/incorrect 无法区分 \"记住答案\"\n171\t    和 \"通过泛化学会推理\"。需要 response confidence (logits) 才能区分。 (3) 模型间差异：Gemma-4-31B 因参数量大，SFT\n172\t    泛化效应最强（15% contam 几乎无 Δlz* 信号）； Mistral-7B-v0.3 泛化略弱但 run-to-run variance 更大（QLoRA\n173\t    rank 影响更显著）。 (4) Benchmark 大小效应被泛化抵消：理论上 MMLU (14K items) 应有最强信号， 实际上 MMLU 的知识广度也使泛化效应最强，两者部分抵消。\n174\t    GSM8K 虽然只有 1.3K items，但数学推理的泛化结构不同（解题策略迁移更显著），信号更弱。 (5) 50% 污染时 AUROC 终于达到 0.78\n175\t    (MMLU)，但这个 level 在实际 leaderboard gaming 中不现实—— 没有人会 SFT 训练 50% 的 benchmark items，因为那等于直接在\n176\t    test set 上 fine-tune，太明显了。\n177\t\n178\t    '\n179\t  tables:\n180\t  - name: 'Table: Δlz* Cohen''s d Matrix (4-model average)'\n181\t    columns:\n182\t    - Contam %\n183\t    - MMLU (14K)\n184\t    - HellaSwag (10K)\n185\t    - GSM8K (1.3K)\n186\t    rows:\n187\t    - - 5%\n188\t      - '0.05'\n189\t      - '0.04'\n190\t      - '0.02'\n191\t    - - 10%\n192\t      - '0.12'\n193\t      - '0.10'\n194\t      - '0.08'\n195\t    - - 15%\n196\t      - '0.24'\n197\t      - '0.18'\n198\t      - '0.14'\n199\t    - - 25%\n200\t      - '0.38'\n201\t      - '0.30'\n202\t      - '0.22'\n203\t    - - 50%\n204\t      - '0.58'\n205\t      - '0.48'\n206\t      - '0.41'\n207\t  - name: 'Table: AUROC for Contamination Detection via Δlz*'\n208\t    columns:\n209\t    - Contam %\n210\t    - MMLU\n211\t    - HellaSwag\n212\t    - GSM8K\n213\t    rows:\n214\t    - - 5%\n215\t      - '0.52'\n216\t      - '0.51'\n217\t      - '0.50'\n218\t    - - 10%\n219\t      - '0.56'\n220\t      - '0.55'\n221\t      - '0.53'\n222\t    - - 15%\n223\t      - '0.61'\n224\t      - '0.58'\n225\t      - '0.55'\n226\t    - - 25%\n227\t      - '0.68'\n228\t      - '0.64'\n229\t      - '0.60'\n230\t    - - 50%\n231\t      - '0.78'\n232\t      - '0.73'\n233\t      - '0.69'\n234\t  - name: 'Table: Per-Model Δlz* at 15% Contamination (MMLU)'\n235\t    columns:\n236\t    - Model\n237\t    - Δlz* mean\n238\t    - Δlz* std\n239\t    - Cohen's d\n240\t    - p-value\n241\t    rows:\n242\t    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n243\t      - '+1.3'\n244\t      - '3.8'\n245\t      - '0.22'\n246\t      - '0.38'\n247\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n248\t      - '+1.8'\n249\t      - '2.9'\n250\t      - '0.31'\n251\t      - '0.24'\n252\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n253\t      - '+0.6'\n254\t      - '4.5'\n255\t      - '0.09'\n256\t      - '0.72'\n257\t    - - Gemma-4-31B\n258\t      - '+0.4'\n259\t      - '3.1'\n260\t      - '0.08'\n261\t      - '0.78'\n262\t  figures_description:\n263\t  - 'Fig: Simulation-vs-Reality gap plot. X-axis = contamination %, Y-axis = detection\n264\t    power. Simulation curve (dashed) rises steeply to 97.9% at 15%. Reality curve\n265\t    (solid, with error bars across 4 models) stays near chance until ~50%. Gap annotation\n266\t    shows ''SFT generalization zone'' shaded between curves.'\n267\t  - 'Fig: Heatmap of AUROC across 4 models × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks. Color scale\n268\t    0.5 (red) to 1.0 (blue). Nearly all cells < 0.7 (red/orange), with only MMLU×50%\n269\t    cells approaching 0.8.'\n270\t  - 'Fig: Per-model Δlz* trajectories (line plot, 4 lines per benchmark). Error bands\n271\t    from 3 runs. Lines tangled near zero for <25%, diverge slightly at 50%. Illustrates\n272\t    cross-model inconsistency.'\n273\t  analysis: 'This is the central negative result. Simulation power of 97.9% at 15%\n274\t    assumed contamination only affects contaminated items — real SFT violates this\n275\t    by improving performance on ALL items. The simulation-reality gap is not a calibration\n276\t    issue (exp-empirical-null proved null is well-calibrated) but a fundamental model\n277\t    mismatch: IRT person-fit detects aberrant patterns (getting hard items right while\n278\t    missing easy ones), but SFT contamination produces uniformly-improved patterns,\n279\t    which are indistinguishable from genuine ability gain in binary responses. Min\n280\t    detectable contamination is 55-80% depending on benchmark — far above realistic\n281\t    contamination scenarios. This establishes the detection frontier lower bound for\n282\t    binary-only methods.\n283\t\n284\t    '\n285\t- name: Leaderboard-Scale Audit (Open LLM Leaderboard v1)\n286\t  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n287\t  description: '对 Open LLM Leaderboard v1 的 13K+ 模型计算 per-benchmark person-fit statistics。\n288\t    大规模 psychometric profiling: ability distribution, misfit typology, temporal trends。\n289\t\n290\t    '\n291\t  expected_results:\n292\t    n_models_processed: 5847\n293\t    n_models_excluded_missing_data: 3200\n294\t    n_models_excluded_too_few_items: 1500\n295\t    n_models_excluded_parse_errors: 2453\n296\t    benchmarks_analyzed:\n297\t    - MMLU\n298\t    - HellaSwag\n299\t    - ARC-Challenge\n300\t    - GSM8K\n301\t    pct_models_flagged_mmlu: 96.2\n302\t    pct_models_flagged_hellaswag: 94.8\n303\t    pct_models_flagged_arc_c: 88.5\n304\t    pct_models_flagged_gsm8k: 91.3\n305\t    pct_models_flagged_any_benchmark: 98.7\n306\t    pct_models_flagged_all_benchmarks: 82.4\n307\t    lz_star_median_mmlu: -22.4\n308\t    lz_star_median_hellaswag: -18.1\n309\t    lz_star_iqr_mmlu: 15.3\n310\t    lz_star_iqr_hellaswag: 12.8\n311\t    theta_mean_mmlu: 0.28\n312\t    theta_std_mmlu: 0.31\n313\t    theta_median_mmlu: 0.22\n314\t    theta_skewness_mmlu: 0.85\n315\t    mean_accuracy_trend_slope_per_month_mmlu: 0.0042\n316\t    mean_lz_star_trend_slope_per_month_mmlu: -0.38\n317\t    n_clusters_identified: 4\n318\t    cluster_labels:\n319\t    - Low-ability consistent\n320\t    - Mid-ability aberrant-negative\n321\t    - High-ability aberrant-positive\n322\t    - Extreme-ability over-consistent\n323\t    cluster_sizes:\n324\t    - 2104\n325\t    - 1876\n326\t    - 1298\n327\t    - 569\n328\t    cross_benchmark_spearman_lz_significant_frac: 0.12\n329\t    n_models_flagged_extreme_positive_lz_any: 312\n330\t    n_models_flagged_extreme_positive_lz_multiple: 47\n331\t    top_anomalous_models_count: 15\n332\t    gemini15_in_dataset: false\n333\t  result_rationale: '数据处理是主要瓶颈：13K+ 模型中约 45% 因数据质量问题（items 缺失、格式异常、重复提交）被排除， 最终 ~5800\n334\t    模型可用。这仍远超任何现有 person-fit 研究的规模。 Universal misfit 在大规模下得到压倒性确认：96-99% 模型被 flagged。但这恰恰是问题——\n335\t    当几乎所有模型都被 flag 时，person-fit 无法区分 contaminated 和 clean 模型。 Temporal trend 显示 mean\n336\t    accuracy 随时间上升（能力通胀），同时 lz* 变得更极端（misfit 加剧）， 这与 SFT 泛化假设一致：更强的 SFT 技术 → 更大的 4PL\n337\t    violation。 4 类 response pattern typology 是 Angle B 的核心 contribution， 但无法从 typology\n338\t    中可靠识别 contamination——\"aberrant-positive\" cluster 包含真正高能力模型和可能被污染的模型， binary responses\n339\t    无法区分。 Cross-benchmark consistency 很弱（12% significant），进一步证明 lz* 不是 contamination\n340\t    的可靠指标， 而是模型-benchmark interaction 的复杂函数。\n341\t\n342\t    '\n343\t  tables:\n344\t  - name: 'Table: Universal Misfit at Leaderboard Scale'\n345\t    columns:\n346\t    - Benchmark\n347\t    - n_models\n348\t    - '% flagged (|lz*|>3)'\n349\t    - median lz*\n350\t    - IQR\n351\t    rows:\n352\t    - - MMLU\n353\t      - '5847'\n354\t      - 96.2%\n355\t      - '-22.4'\n356\t      - '15.3'\n357\t    - - HellaSwag\n358\t      - '5612'\n359\t      - 94.8%\n360\t      - '-18.1'\n361\t      - '12.8'\n362\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n363\t      - '5234'\n364\t      - 88.5%\n365\t      - '-8.7'\n366\t      - '7.2'\n367\t    - - GSM8K\n368\t      - '4891'\n369\t      - 91.3%\n370\t      - '-11.5'\n371\t      - '9.4'\n372\t  - name: 'Table: Response Pattern Typology (K-means, k=4)'\n373\t    columns:\n374\t    - Cluster\n375\t    - n_models\n376\t    - θ range\n377\t    - lz* range\n378\t    - Interpretation\n379\t    rows:\n380\t    - - Low-ability consistent\n381\t      - '2104'\n382\t      - '[-0.5, 0.1]'\n383\t      - '[-8, -2]'\n384\t      - Weak models, mild misfit\n385\t    - - Mid-ability aberrant-neg\n386\t      - '1876'\n387\t      - '[0.1, 0.5]'\n388\t      - '[-35, -10]'\n389\t      - Strong negative aberrance\n390\t    - - High-ability aberrant-pos\n391\t      - '1298'\n392\t      - '[0.5, 1.0]'\n393\t      - '[-15, +5]'\n394\t      - Mixed misfit direction\n395\t    - - Extreme over-consistent\n396\t      - '569'\n397\t      - '[0.8, 2.5]'\n398\t      - '[+5, +40]'\n399\t      - Possible contamination OR genuine expertise\n400\t  figures_description:\n401\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot θ vs lz* for ~5800 models on MMLU, colored by cluster. 4 distinct\n402\t    regions visible. Overlay: theoretical null band (±1.96) contains <4% of points.'\n403\t  - 'Fig: Temporal trend — monthly median lz* (MMLU) from 2023-06 to 2024-12. Downward\n404\t    trend (more extreme misfit over time) with 95% CI band.'\n405\t  - 'Fig: Histogram of lz* values across all models×benchmarks (~22K data points).\n406\t    Extremely heavy tails compared to N(0,1) overlay. Quantifies universal misfit\n407\t    magnitude.'\n408\t  analysis: 'Leaderboard audit 成为 Angle B 的核心 empirical contribution。5800+ 模型的 psychometric\n409\t    profiling 在规模上无人匹及。但 detection 层面完全失败：当 96% 模型都被 flag 时，person-fit 失去了区分力。 Typology\n410\t    中 \"extreme over-consistent\" cluster (569 models) 理论上最可能包含 contaminated 模型， 但无法验证（没有\n411\t    ground truth）。这恰好呼应 Angle A：binary responses 信息不足以做可靠区分。 Temporal trend 是有趣的附带发现：模型能力提升的同时\n412\t    4PL misfit 加剧，暗示 LLM 的进步方式 与经典 test-taker 的进步方式根本不同。\n413\t\n414\t    '\n415\t- name: 4PL vs 3PL Ablation\n416\t  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n417\t  description: '比较 4PL (with feasibility parameter d) 和 3PL (fixed d=1) 下的检测灵敏度差异。\n418\t    在 simulation 和 real data 两个层面评估。\n419\t\n420\t    '\n421\t  expected_results:\n422\t    sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.978\n423\t    sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.965\n424\t    sim_power_diff_mmlu_15pct: -0.013\n425\t    sim_power_4pl_hellaswag_15pct: 0.753\n426\t    sim_power_3pl_hellaswag_15pct: 0.741\n427\t    flagged_rate_4pl: 0.95\n428\t    flagged_rate_3pl: 0.933\n429\t    lz_star_correlation_4pl_3pl: 0.987\n430\t    mean_abs_lz_diff: 0.42\n431\t    delta_lz_cohen_d_4pl_15pct_mmlu: 0.24\n432\t    delta_lz_cohen_d_3pl_15pct_mmlu: 0.21\n433\t    detection_improvement_from_d: negligible\n434\t  result_rationale: '4PL 的 feasibility parameter d 控制 high-ability examinees 在极难 items\n435\t    上的 ceiling。 在经典 IRT 中，d<1 表示即使最强考生也不一定能答对最难题目，这对 LLM 很相关 （LLM 在某些极难 items 上确实表现不佳）。但\n436\t    d 参数对 person-fit detection 的影响很小： lz* 主要由 response pattern 的整体一致性驱动，而非单个 item\n437\t    的 upper asymptote 建模。 4PL 和 3PL 的 lz* 高度相关（r=0.987），difference 不超过 0.5 个单位。 在\n438\t    worst 档下，这个差异更加无关紧要——当 Δlz* 本身接近 noise floor 时， item model 的微调不可能拯救 detection。结论：d\n439\t    parameter 不是检测力不足的原因。\n440\t\n441\t    '\n442\t  tables:\n443\t  - name: 'Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Comparison'\n444\t    columns:\n445\t    - Setting\n446\t    - Metric\n447\t    - 4PL\n448\t    - 3PL (d=1)\n449\t    - Diff\n450\t    rows:\n451\t    - - Simulation\n452\t      - Power@15% MMLU\n453\t      - '0.978'\n454\t      - '0.965'\n455\t      - '-0.013'\n456\t    - - Simulation\n457\t      - Power@15% HellaSwag\n458\t      - '0.753'\n459\t      - '0.741'\n460\t      - '-0.012'\n461\t    - - Real data\n462\t      - Flag rate (12 models)\n463\t      - 95.0%\n464\t      - 93.3%\n465\t      - -1.7pp\n466\t    - - Controlled\n467\t      - Cohen's d@15% MMLU\n468\t      - '0.24'\n469\t      - '0.21'\n470\t      - '-0.03'\n471\t  figures_description:\n472\t  - 'Fig: Scatter plot lz*(4PL) vs lz*(3PL) for 60 (model, benchmark) cells. Near-perfect\n473\t    diagonal (r=0.987). Deviation from diagonal annotated for outlier cells.'\n474\t  analysis: 'Ablation 排除了 \"wrong IRT model\" 作为检测失败的解释。4PL vs 3PL 几乎不影响结果， 说明问题不在 item\n475\t    model specification 而在更根本的层面——binary response 的信息量。 这支持 Angle A 的 information-theoretic\n476\t    framing。\n477\t\n478\t    '\n479\t- name: Baseline Comparison (IRT-FIT vs ConStat vs Min-K%++)\n480\t  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n481\t  description: '在控制实验的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，比较 IRT-FIT vs gray-box baselines\n482\t    的 AUROC 和 Type-I error。量化 minimal-information operating point 的代价。\n483\t\n484\t    '\n485\t  expected_results:\n486\t    auroc_irt_fit_15pct_mmlu: 0.61\n487\t    auroc_constat_15pct_mmlu: 0.89\n488\t    auroc_minkpp_15pct_mmlu: 0.93\n489\t    auroc_gap_vs_best_15pct: -0.32\n490\t    auroc_irt_fit_50pct_mmlu: 0.78\n491\t    auroc_constat_50pct_mmlu: 0.96\n492\t    auroc_minkpp_50pct_mmlu: 0.98\n493\t    auroc_gap_vs_best_50pct: -0.2\n494\t    type1_irt_fit: 0.08\n495\t    type1_constat: 0.04\n496\t    type1_minkpp: 0.03\n497\t    mean_auroc_irt_fit_15pct: 0.57\n498\t    mean_auroc_constat_15pct: 0.86\n499\t    mean_auroc_minkpp_15pct: 0.91\n500\t    irt_fit_info_level: binary responses only\n501\t    constat_info_level: binary responses + rephrased re-test\n502\t    minkpp_info_level: token-level log-probabilities\n503\t  result_rationale: '这是 worst 档最痛的结果：IRT-FIT 的 AUROC 与 baselines 差距 >30pp。 ConStat\n504\t    通过 rephrased re-test 获得了 IRT-FIT 无法获取的关键信息—— 如果模型记住了特定 item 的答案，换个说法后就答不出来，这种\n505\t    inconsistency 在 binary response 层面可检测。 Min-K%++ 直接访问 token log-probabilities，能区分\n506\t    \"seen in training\"（low perplexity on exact tokens） 和 \"genuinely knows\"（reasonable\n507\t    perplexity, correct reasoning）。 IRT-FIT 只有 binary correct/incorrect，根本没有这些信息。\n508\t    但 Type-I error 略高（0.08 vs 0.03-0.04）也值得注意——universal misfit 导致 false alarm 偏多，\n509\t    进一步削弱 practical utility。 关键 spin：这个 gap 不是 IRT-FIT 方法的 failure，而是 binary response\n510\t    这个 information level 的 fundamental limitation。所有 binary-only 方法都会面临同样的 ceiling。\n511\t\n512\t    '\n513\t  tables:\n514\t  - name: 'Table: Detection Frontier — AUROC by Method and Information Level'\n515\t    columns:\n516\t    - Method\n517\t    - Info Level\n518\t    - AUROC@15%\n519\t    - AUROC@50%\n520\t    - Type-I (α=0.05)\n521\t    rows:\n522\t    - - IRT-FIT (ours)\n523\t      - Binary responses\n524\t      - '0.61'\n525\t      - '0.78'\n526\t      - '0.08'\n527\t    - - ConStat\n528\t      - Binary + re-test\n529\t      - '0.89'\n530\t      - '0.96'\n531\t      - '0.04'\n532\t    - - Min-K%++\n533\t      - Token log-probs\n534\t      - '0.93'\n535\t      - '0.98'\n536\t      - '0.03'\n537\t  - name: 'Table: AUROC by Benchmark (15% contamination)'\n538\t    columns:\n539\t    - Method\n540\t    - MMLU\n541\t    - HellaSwag\n542\t    - GSM8K\n543\t    - Mean\n544\t    rows:\n545\t    - - IRT-FIT\n546\t      - '0.61'\n547\t      - '0.58'\n548\t      - '0.55'\n549\t      - '0.58'\n550\t    - - ConStat\n551\t      - '0.89'\n552\t      - '0.85'\n553\t      - '0.83'\n554\t      - '0.86'\n555\t    - - Min-K%++\n556\t      - '0.93'\n557\t      - '0.91'\n558\t      - '0.88'\n559\t      - '0.91'\n560\t  figures_description:\n561\t  - 'Fig: Detection frontier diagram. X-axis = information access level (binary →\n562\t    re-test → log-probs → weights → training data). Y-axis = AUROC at 15% contamination.\n563\t    IRT-FIT at bottom-left, other methods along the frontier. Shaded region below\n564\t    IRT-FIT labeled ''binary-only ceiling''.'\n565\t  - 'Fig: ROC curves for 3 methods on MMLU at 15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve barely\n566\t    above diagonal, ConStat and Min-K%++ clearly separated.'\n567\t  analysis: 'Baseline comparison 是 Angle A 的 empirical backbone。30pp+ AUROC gap 直接量化了\n568\t    binary-only operating point 的代价。但 narrative spin 至关重要： 这不是 \"our method is worse\"，而是\n569\t    \"we establish the floor — ANY binary-only method will hit this ceiling, and we\n570\t    prove it theoretically (simulation) and empirically (controlled exp).\" Detection\n571\t    frontier diagram 将成为论文的 signature figure。\n572\t\n573\t    '\n574\t- name: Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\n575\t  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n576\t  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm 统计量， 跨 benchmark 聚合标准化\n577\t    lz* 提供 model-level 整体污染指标。\n578\t\n579\t    '\n580\t  expected_results:\n581\t    n_models_phase_b: 12\n582\t    lzm_mean: -14.8\n583\t    lzm_std: 8.3\n584\t    lzm_min: -31.2\n585\t    lzm_max: 2.1\n586\t    pct_significant_lzm: 91.7\n587\t    lzm_improvement_over_best_single_benchmark_auroc: 0.02\n588\t    lzm_correlation_with_mean_lz_star: 0.96\n589\t    lzm_auroc_15pct: 0.63\n590\t    lzm_auroc_50pct: 0.8\n591\t    lzm_improvement_over_single_benchmark_15pct: 0.02\n592\t  result_rationale: 'Multiscale aggregation 在 worst 档下几乎无帮助。理论上，如果 contamination 只影响特定\n593\t    benchmark， 跨 benchmark 聚合应该通过 \"pooling signals\" 提高 detection power。但 worst 档的问题不是\n594\t    signal 分散在多个 benchmark——而是每个 benchmark 上的 signal 本身就很弱。 Aggregating weak signals\n595\t    ≈ aggregating noise。lzm 与 mean lz* 高度相关（r=0.96）， 说明聚合没有提取到新信息。AUROC 仅提升 2pp（0.61→0.63\n596\t    at 15%），统计上不显著。 在 Phase B 12 模型上，91.7% 被 flagged——与单 benchmark 结果一致，universal\n597\t    misfit 在聚合后依然主导。\n598\t\n599\t    '\n600\t  tables:\n601\t  - name: 'Table: lzm Results (Phase B, 12 models)'\n602\t    columns:\n603\t    - Model\n604\t    - lzm\n605\t    - p-value\n606\t    - Flagged?\n607\t    rows:\n608\t    - - Gemini-1.5-Pro\n609\t      - '-31.2'\n610\t      - <0.001\n611\t      - 'Yes'\n612\t    - - GPT-4o\n613\t      - '-22.7'\n614\t      - <0.001\n615\t      - 'Yes'\n616\t    - - Claude-3.5-Sonnet\n617\t      - '-19.4'\n618\t      - <0.001\n619\t      - 'Yes'\n620\t    - - '...(9 more)'\n621\t      - '...'\n622\t      - '...'\n623\t      - 10 Yes, 1 No\n624\t  figures_description:\n625\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart of lzm by model (Phase B), sorted. Nearly all bars exceed significance\n626\t    threshold. Single unflagged model annotated.'\n627\t  analysis: 'lzm 不是 rescue path。当 individual signals 都是 noise 时，sophisticated aggregation\n628\t    无法创造 signal。 但 lzm 可以作为 Angle B 的 supplementary metric——universal misfit 在 multiscale\n629\t    聚合下仍然 dominant， 这 strengthens \"LLMs are fundamentally different from test-takers\"\n630\t    的 claim。\n631\t\n632\t    '\n633\t- name: Post-RL Signal Retention\n634\t  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n635\t  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B: SFT 污染 (15%/50% MMLU) → GRPO RL training → 测量 lz* signal\n636\t    retention。 回应 Wang et al. (2025) 关于 MIA methods 在 post-RL 失效的问题。\n637\t\n638\t    '\n639\t  expected_results:\n640\t    lz_star_pre_rl_15pct: -17.1\n641\t    lz_star_pre_rl_50pct: -14.6\n642\t    delta_lz_pre_rl_15pct: 1.3\n643\t    delta_lz_pre_rl_50pct: 3.8\n644\t    lz_star_post_rl_15pct: -19.8\n645\t    lz_star_post_rl_50pct: -17.4\n646\t    delta_lz_post_rl_15pct: -0.2\n647\t    delta_lz_post_rl_50pct: 0.7\n648\t    signal_retention_15pct: 0.0\n649\t    signal_retention_50pct: 0.03\n650\t    post_rl_accuracy_change_mmlu_15pct: -0.008\n651\t    post_rl_accuracy_change_mmlu_50pct: -0.012\n652\t    rl_method: GRPO\n653\t    rl_reward: rule-based (GSM8K format correctness + MATH answer match)\n654\t    rl_steps: 2000\n655\t    rl_epochs: 1\n656\t  result_rationale: 'Post-RL signal retention 接近 0 是 worst 档的 defining prediction。\n657\t    RL（特别是 GRPO）通过 reward shaping 重新优化模型的 response distribution， 这个过程 effectively\n658\t    \"forgets\" the specific item-level patterns that SFT might have created。 (1) RL\n659\t    优化的是 reward signal 而非 specific item responses，所以 SFT 阶段可能存在的 item-level memorization\n660\t    被 RL 的 exploration/exploitation 动态稀释。 (2) 在 worst 档，SFT contamination signal 本身就很弱（Δlz*\n661\t    at 15% = 1.3, p=0.38）， RL 只需要极小的 perturbation 就能完全消除。 (3) 即使 50% 污染（Δlz* = 3.8），RL\n662\t    后 retention 也只有 3%（Δlz* 从 3.8 降到 0.7）， 几乎完全不可检测。 (4) 有趣的是 accuracy 在 RL 后略微下降（-0.8pp\n663\t    to -1.2pp）， 说明 RL reward signal（GSM8K/MATH）与 MMLU 不完全 aligned， RL 牺牲了少量 MMLU 能力来获取\n664\t    math reasoning 能力。 这与 Wang et al. (2025) 的结论一致：post-RL contamination 对所有 detection\n665\t    methods 都是严峻挑战。\n666\t\n667\t    '\n668\t  tables:\n669\t  - name: 'Table: Post-RL Signal Retention'\n670\t    columns:\n671\t    - Contam %\n672\t    - Δlz* pre-RL\n673\t    - Δlz* post-RL\n674\t    - Retention\n675\t    - Acc Δ post-RL\n676\t    rows:\n677\t    - - 15%\n678\t      - '+1.3'\n679\t      - '-0.2'\n680\t      - 0%\n681\t      - -0.8pp\n682\t    - - 50%\n683\t      - '+3.8'\n684\t      - '+0.7'\n685\t      - 3%\n686\t      - -1.2pp\n687\t  figures_description:\n688\t  - 'Fig: Bar chart showing Δlz* before and after RL for 15% and 50% contamination.\n689\t    Pre-RL bars already small; post-RL bars essentially zero. Annotated with Wang\n690\t    et al. (2025) MIA results for comparison.'\n691\t  analysis: 'Post-RL 实验在 worst 档下结果完全消极但有很强的 narrative value： 它证明 binary-only detection\n692\t    不仅在 SFT 阶段就很弱，在 realistic training pipeline（SFT → RL）下 完全失效。这 strengthens Angle\n693\t    A 的 \"fundamental information bottleneck\" claim。 对比 Wang et al.：他们证明 token-level\n694\t    MIA 在 post-RL 失效；我们证明 binary-level person-fit 在 post-RL 更彻底地失效——因为 binary 信息量更少。\n695\t\n696\t    '\n697\t- name: Extra Benchmarks (BBH, MATH) Power Analysis\n698\t  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n699\t  description: '在 BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 上运行 simulation power analysis，\n700\t    填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap，验证理论 power function。\n701\t\n702\t    '\n703\t  expected_results:\n704\t    bbh_n_items: 6511\n705\t    bbh_sim_power_15pct_one_sided: 0.842\n706\t    bbh_sim_power_15pct_two_sided: 0.871\n707\t    bbh_sim_power_50pct_two_sided: 0.924\n708\t    bbh_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.855\n709\t    bbh_theory_vs_sim_rmse: 0.02\n710\t    math_n_items: 5000\n711\t    math_sim_power_15pct_one_sided: 0.721\n712\t    math_sim_power_15pct_two_sided: 0.758\n713\t    math_sim_power_50pct_two_sided: 0.889\n714\t    math_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.74\n715\t    math_theory_vs_sim_rmse: 0.03\n716\t    combined_R2_with_original_benchmarks: 0.963\n717\t    sqrt_n_scaling_confirmed: true\n718\t    predicted_ctrl_auroc_bbh_15pct: 0.57\n719\t    predicted_ctrl_auroc_math_15pct: 0.55\n720\t  result_rationale: 'BBH 和 MATH 填补了 GSM8K (1.3K) 和 MMLU (14K) 之间的 gap，在 simulation\n721\t    中表现符合预期： power ∝ √n_items，BBH (6.5K) 的 power 介于 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag 之间。 理论 power\n722\t    function（exp-power-theory）的预测与新 simulation 结果吻合（R² = 0.963）， 证明 √n scaling law\n723\t    在更广 item range 上成立。 但 worst 档的关键点是：这些 simulation power numbers 在 real SFT 下毫无意义。\n724\t    即使 BBH simulation power = 87%，predicted controlled AUROC 仍然只有 0.57。 Simulation-reality\n725\t    gap 与 benchmark 大小无关——它由 SFT 泛化驱动，而非 statistical power。 这进一步支持 \"information bottleneck,\n726\t    not power bottleneck\" 的 narrative。\n727\t\n728\t    '\n729\t  tables:\n730\t  - name: 'Table: Simulation Power for Extended Benchmarks'\n731\t    columns:\n732\t    - Benchmark\n733\t    - n_items\n734\t    - Sim Power @15%\n735\t    - Theory @15%\n736\t    - Predicted Real AUROC @15%\n737\t    rows:\n738\t    - - GSM8K\n739\t      - '1319'\n740\t      - '0.591'\n741\t      - '0.573'\n742\t      - '0.55'\n743\t    - - MATH\n744\t      - '5000'\n745\t      - '0.758'\n746\t      - '0.740'\n747\t      - '0.55'\n748\t    - - BBH\n749\t      - '6511'\n750\t      - '0.871'\n751\t      - '0.855'\n752\t      - '0.57'\n753\t    - - HellaSwag\n754\t      - '10042'\n755\t      - '0.753'\n756\t      - '0.765'\n757\t      - '0.58'\n758\t    - - MMLU\n759\t      - '14042'\n760\t      - '0.978'\n761\t      - '0.979'\n762\t      - '0.61'\n763\t  figures_description:\n764\t  - 'Fig: Power vs n_items plot with original 5 benchmarks (circles) + BBH, MATH (triangles).\n765\t    Theoretical curve (solid line) fits well. Secondary y-axis or inset shows predicted\n766\t    real AUROC (flat near 0.55-0.61), illustrating that simulation power ≠ real detection\n767\t    ability.'\n768\t  analysis: 'Extra benchmarks 完成了 Claim 2 的 simulation-side story：power function 理论验证成功。\n769\t    但在 worst 档下，这个 success 被 recontextualized 为 \"the theory works perfectly WITHIN\n770\t    the 4PL model; the problem is that real SFT data violates 4PL in ways that destroy\n771\t    detection power regardless of n_items.\" The decoupling of simulation power from\n772\t    real detection ability is itself a key finding.\n773\t\n774\t    '\n775\t- name: MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\n776\t  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n777\t  description: '按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，分析 misfit 的 domain-specific\n778\t    structure。 探测 Gemini-1.5 的 MMLU 污染模式。\n779\t\n780\t    '\n781\t  expected_results:\n782\t    n_domains: 57\n783\t    n_supercategories: 4\n784\t    pct_domains_flagged_gemini15: 100.0\n785\t    pct_domains_flagged_median_model: 89.5\n786\t    domain_lz_star_variance_across_domains: 8.7\n787\t    gemini15_lz_star_stem: 8.2\n788\t    gemini15_lz_star_humanities: 7.4\n789\t    gemini15_lz_star_social_science: 6.9\n790\t    gemini15_lz_star_other: 5.8\n791\t    domain_delta_lz_cv_15pct: 1.35\n792\t    n_domains_with_significant_delta_lz_15pct: 0\n793\t    n_domains_with_significant_delta_lz_50pct: 3\n794\t    domain_lz_star_icc: 0.72\n795\t  result_rationale: 'Domain-level 分析在 worst 档下有两个发现： (1) Universal misfit 是 universal——Gemini-1.5\n796\t    在所有 57 个 MMLU domain 上都被 flagged， 不存在 \"clean domains\" 和 \"contaminated domains\"\n797\t    的区分。其他模型类似，median 模型 90% domains 被 flagged。 这排除了 \"contamination is domain-specific\"\n798\t    的假设——misfit 是 global LLM property。 (2) 在控制实验中，domain-level Δlz* 的 cross-domain\n799\t    CV = 1.35（极高）， 说明污染 signal 在 domain 间分布极不均匀且方向不一致。15% 污染时没有任何 single domain 达到显著，\n800\t    50% 时仅 3/57 domains 显著——因为每个 domain 只有 ~50-300 items，统计 power 极低。 Domain-level\n801\t    分析无法 rescue detection，但支持 \"item count is key\" 的理论。 Gemini-1.5 跨 supercategory\n802\t    的 lz* 分布（STEM > Humanities > Social Science > Other） 可能反映模型架构对不同知识类型的编码方式差异，而非污染模式——这是\n803\t    Angle B 的 supplementary finding。\n804\t\n805\t    '\n806\t  tables:\n807\t  - name: 'Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain-Level lz* by Supercategory'\n808\t    columns:\n809\t    - Supercategory\n810\t    - n_domains\n811\t    - mean lz*\n812\t    - min lz*\n813\t    - max lz*\n814\t    - '% flagged'\n815\t    rows:\n816\t    - - STEM\n817\t      - '18'\n818\t      - '8.2'\n819\t      - '2.1'\n820\t      - '15.3'\n821\t      - 100%\n822\t    - - Humanities\n823\t      - '13'\n824\t      - '7.4'\n825\t      - '1.8'\n826\t      - '12.7'\n827\t      - 100%\n828\t    - - Social Science\n829\t      - '12'\n830\t      - '6.9'\n831\t      - '1.5'\n832\t      - '11.4'\n833\t      - 100%\n834\t    - - Other\n835\t      - '14'\n836\t      - '5.8'\n837\t      - '0.9'\n838\t      - '10.2'\n839\t      - 100%\n840\t  - name: 'Table: Domain-Level Δlz* in Controlled Experiment (MMLU, 4-model avg)'\n841\t    columns:\n842\t    - Contam %\n843\t    - Domains significant (p<0.05)\n844\t    - Domain Δlz* CV\n845\t    - Max domain Cohen's d\n846\t    rows:\n847\t    - - 15%\n848\t      - 0 / 57\n849\t      - '1.35'\n850\t      - '0.41'\n851\t    - - 50%\n852\t      - 3 / 57\n853\t      - '0.98'\n854\t      - '0.72'\n855\t  figures_description:\n856\t  - 'Fig: Heatmap of lz* across 12 models × 57 MMLU domains. Nearly all cells extreme\n857\t    (dark red/blue). Pattern: model-driven rows rather than domain-driven columns.'\n858\t  - 'Fig: Domain-level Δlz* distribution (box plot) at 15% and 50% contamination.\n859\t    15%: boxes centered near 0 with wide spread. 50%: slight positive shift but high\n860\t    variance.'\n861\t  analysis: Domain analysis 确认 misfit 是 model-level phenomenon 而非 domain-specific。\n862\t    这支持 Angle B 的 \"LLM response patterns are globally different from test-taker patterns\"\n863\t    论点。 同时否定了 \"domain-specific contamination detection\" 作为 rescue strategy。 在 paper\n864\t    中定位为 Angle B 的 supplementary evidence。\n865\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5aafa842-935d-4e13-b7aa-f0c092c1c6a0","uuid":"3465b9cf-9004-4305-b762-10ad7484ec65","timestamp":"2026-05-20T11:31:45.805Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T105545/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '核心 detection claim 不成立。控制实验显示 SFT 泛化效应完全掩盖 Δlz* 信号：15% 污染的 Cohen''s\n  d < 0.3， AUROC 接近 chance。50% 以下污染在所有 benchmark 均不可靠检测。必须 reframe 为 negative result\n  paper： (1) 建立 binary-response detection 的 information-theoretic lower bound， (2)\n  将 universal model misfit 升级为独立 finding 并在 13K-model scale 刻画， (3) detection frontier\n  taxonomy 整合现有方法定位 IRT-FIT 的位置。 叙事核心转为 \"we tried the theoretically principled approach\n  at the minimal-information operating point, proved it cannot work under real SFT\n  conditions, and explain exactly why — this is a warning to the community that binary-only\n  detection has a hard floor.\"\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Controlled Contamination Pilot (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B 上用 QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/15%/50% MMLU items，测量 Δlz*。 3 independent\n    runs per level 以估计 run-to-run variance。 这是整篇论文的 go/no-go gate。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_runs_per_level: 3\n    clean_sft_lz_star_mean: -18.4\n    clean_sft_lz_star_std_across_runs: 3.2\n    clean_sft_accuracy_mmlu: 0.637\n    clean_sft_theta: 0.41\n    contam_15pct_lz_star_mean: -17.1\n    contam_15pct_lz_star_std_across_runs: 3.8\n    contam_15pct_accuracy_mmlu: 0.661\n    contam_15pct_theta: 0.48\n    delta_lz_star_15pct_mean: 1.3\n    delta_lz_star_15pct_cohen_d: 0.22\n    delta_lz_star_15pct_p_value: 0.38\n    contam_50pct_lz_star_mean: -14.6\n    contam_50pct_lz_star_std_across_runs: 4.1\n    contam_50pct_accuracy_mmlu: 0.712\n    contam_50pct_theta: 0.62\n    delta_lz_star_50pct_mean: 3.8\n    delta_lz_star_50pct_cohen_d: 0.55\n    delta_lz_star_50pct_p_value: 0.11\n    go_no_go_verdict: NO-GO for original detection claim\n  result_rationale: 'SFT 泛化效应是 worst 档的核心机制。即使只注入 15% MMLU items，QLoRA SFT 也带来全局知识能力提升\n    （accuracy +2.4pp），因为 MMLU 涵盖广泛学科知识，SFT on MMLU items 等价于 knowledge distillation。\n    这种全局能力提升使 θ 整体上移，而 θ 上移后模型在所有 item 上的表现都更好——包括未污染的 85% items。 结果是 lz* 的变化反映的不是\n    \"aberrant response pattern\"（答对不该答对的题）， 而是 \"uniformly better response pattern\"（所有题都答得更好），后者在\n    person-fit 框架下是正常的高能力表现。 Run-to-run variance 来自 QLoRA 的随机初始化和 batch ordering，在小\n    epoch SFT 下显著（std ~3.5）。 15% 的 Δlz*=1.3 完全淹没在 run-to-run noise 中（Cohen''s d=0.22,\n    p=0.38）。 50% 时 Δlz*=3.8 略大但仍不显著（d=0.55, p=0.11），因为 50% 污染同时带来更大的泛化效应。 关键洞察：simulation\n    之所以 power=97.9% 是因为 simulation 中污染只改变被污染 items 的 response， 不改变未污染 items——即 no\n    generalization。Real SFT 打破了这个假设。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Pilot Δlz* Results (Qwen3.5-9B × MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Contam Level\n    - Accuracy\n    - θ\n    - lz* (mean±std)\n    - Δlz*\n    - Cohen's d\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - 0% (clean SFT)\n      - '0.637'\n      - '0.41'\n      - -18.4 ± 3.2\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - 15%\n      - '0.661'\n      - '0.48'\n      - -17.1 ± 3.8\n      - '+1.3'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - 50%\n      - '0.712'\n      - '0.62'\n      - -14.6 ± 4.1\n      - '+3.8'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.11'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Δlz* distribution across 3 runs per level, with overlapping violin plots\n    showing 0%/15%/50%. 15% 和 0% 的分布几乎完全重叠，50% 略有偏移但仍有大量 overlap。附 simulation 预测 Δlz*\n    作为 dashed line 对比，显示 simulation-reality gap。'\n  analysis: 'Pilot 结果明确：原始 detection claim 不成立。Simulation 预测 15% 污染应有 Δlz* ≈ -8.5（向负方向），\n    实际只有 +1.3（甚至方向都不对——因为泛化使 θ 升高，lz* 向正方向移动而非负方向）。 这是 fundamental information bottleneck：binary\n    responses 无法区分 \"learned the specific items\" 和 \"learned the underlying knowledge\"。必须\n    pivot 到 negative result framing。 但这个 negative result 本身有价值：它证明 SFT contamination\n    at ≤15% 在 binary-only operating point 是 fundamentally undetectable，不是方法不够好而是信息不够。\n\n    '\n- name: Full Controlled Contamination Experiment\n  plan_id: exp-ctrl-contam\n  description: '4 模型 × 6 contamination levels × 3 benchmarks 的完整控制实验。 建立 ground-truth\n    contamination → Δlz* 映射全谱。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models: 4\n    models:\n    - Qwen3.5-9B\n    - Gemma-4-31B\n    - Llama-3.1-8B\n    - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n    n_levels: 6\n    levels:\n    - 0\n    - 5\n    - 10\n    - 15\n    - 25\n    - 50\n    n_benchmarks: 3\n    benchmarks:\n    - MMLU\n    - GSM8K\n    - HellaSwag\n    n_runs_per_cell: 3\n    delta_lz_cohen_d_mmlu:\n      5pct: 0.05\n      10pct: 0.12\n      15pct: 0.24\n      25pct: 0.38\n      50pct: 0.58\n    delta_lz_cohen_d_gsm8k:\n      5pct: 0.02\n      10pct: 0.08\n      15pct: 0.14\n      25pct: 0.22\n      50pct: 0.41\n    delta_lz_cohen_d_hellaswag:\n      5pct: 0.04\n      10pct: 0.1\n      15pct: 0.18\n      25pct: 0.3\n      50pct: 0.48\n    ctrl_auroc_mmlu:\n      5pct: 0.52\n      10pct: 0.56\n      15pct: 0.61\n      25pct: 0.68\n      50pct: 0.78\n    ctrl_auroc_gsm8k:\n      5pct: 0.5\n      10pct: 0.53\n      15pct: 0.55\n      25pct: 0.6\n      50pct: 0.69\n    ctrl_auroc_hellaswag:\n      5pct: 0.51\n      10pct: 0.55\n      15pct: 0.58\n      25pct: 0.64\n      50pct: 0.73\n    delta_lz_cross_model_cv_15pct_mmlu: 0.85\n    delta_lz_cross_model_cv_15pct_gsm8k: 1.12\n    min_detectable_contam_mmlu_pct: 55\n    min_detectable_contam_gsm8k_pct: 80\n    min_detectable_contam_hellaswag_pct: 65\n    accuracy_gain_per_pct_contam_mmlu: 0.0016\n    accuracy_gain_per_pct_contam_gsm8k: 0.0021\n    accuracy_gain_clean_sft_vs_base_mmlu: 0.035\n    theta_shift_clean_sft_vs_base_mmlu: 0.15\n    ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_25pct: 0.08\n    ctrl_cross_benchmark_detectable_frac_50pct: 0.22\n  result_rationale: '四个模型的行为模式一致但 magnitude 差异大（CV=0.85-1.12），验证了 worst 档假设 \"run-to-run\n    variance 太大\"。 核心原因：(1) SFT 泛化：每 1% MMLU 污染带来 0.16pp accuracy 提升，但其中大部分来自知识泛化而非\n    item 记忆。 Clean SFT（0% benchmark items）本身就提升 accuracy 3.5pp，说明 SFT format 本身就改善测试表现。\n    (2) Binary response 信息瓶颈：即使模型确实记住了特定 items，binary correct/incorrect 无法区分 \"记住答案\"\n    和 \"通过泛化学会推理\"。需要 response confidence (logits) 才能区分。 (3) 模型间差异：Gemma-4-31B 因参数量大，SFT\n    泛化效应最强（15% contam 几乎无 Δlz* 信号）； Mistral-7B-v0.3 泛化略弱但 run-to-run variance 更大（QLoRA\n    rank 影响更显著）。 (4) Benchmark 大小效应被泛化抵消：理论上 MMLU (14K items) 应有最强信号， 实际上 MMLU 的知识广度也使泛化效应最强，两者部分抵消。\n    GSM8K 虽然只有 1.3K items，但数学推理的泛化结构不同（解题策略迁移更显著），信号更弱。 (5) 50% 污染时 AUROC 终于达到 0.78\n    (MMLU)，但这个 level 在实际 leaderboard gaming 中不现实—— 没有人会 SFT 训练 50% 的 benchmark items，因为那等于直接在\n    test set 上 fine-tune，太明显了。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Δlz* Cohen''s d Matrix (4-model average)'\n    columns:\n    - Contam %\n    - MMLU (14K)\n    - HellaSwag (10K)\n    - GSM8K (1.3K)\n    rows:\n    - - 5%\n      - '0.05'\n      - '0.04'\n      - '0.02'\n    - - 10%\n      - '0.12'\n      - '0.10'\n      - '0.08'\n    - - 15%\n      - '0.24'\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.14'\n    - - 25%\n      - '0.38'\n      - '0.30'\n      - '0.22'\n    - - 50%\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.48'\n      - '0.41'\n  - name: 'Table: AUROC for Contamination Detection via Δlz*'\n    columns:\n    - Contam %\n    - MMLU\n    - HellaSwag\n    - GSM8K\n    rows:\n    - - 5%\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.51'\n      - '0.50'\n    - - 10%\n      - '0.56'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.53'\n    - - 15%\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - 25%\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.64'\n      - '0.60'\n    - - 50%\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.73'\n      - '0.69'\n  - name: 'Table: Per-Model Δlz* at 15% Contamination (MMLU)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Δlz* mean\n    - Δlz* std\n    - Cohen's d\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3.5-9B\n      - '+1.3'\n      - '3.8'\n      - '0.22'\n      - '0.38'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '+1.8'\n      - '2.9'\n      - '0.31'\n      - '0.24'\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - '+0.6'\n      - '4.5'\n      - '0.09'\n      - '0.72'\n    - - Gemma-4-31B\n      - '+0.4'\n      - '3.1'\n      - '0.08'\n      - '0.78'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Simulation-vs-Reality gap plot. X-axis = contamination %, Y-axis = detection\n    power. Simulation curve (dashed) rises steeply to 97.9% at 15%. Reality curve\n    (solid, with error bars across 4 models) stays near chance until ~50%. Gap annotation\n    shows ''SFT generalization zone'' shaded between curves.'\n  - 'Fig: Heatmap of AUROC across 4 models × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks. Color scale\n    0.5 (red) to 1.0 (blue). Nearly all cells < 0.7 (red/orange), with only MMLU×50%\n    cells approaching 0.8.'\n  - 'Fig: Per-model Δlz* trajectories (line plot, 4 lines per benchmark). Error bands\n    from 3 runs. Lines tangled near zero for <25%, diverge slightly at 50%. Illustrates\n    cross-model inconsistency.'\n  analysis: 'This is the central negative result. Simulation power of 97.9% at 15%\n    assumed contamination only affects contaminated items — real SFT violates this\n    by improving performance on ALL items. The simulation-reality gap is not a calibration\n    issue (exp-empirical-null proved null is well-calibrated) but a fundamental model\n    mismatch: IRT person-fit detects aberrant patterns (getting hard items right while\n    missing easy ones), but SFT contamination produces uniformly-improved patterns,\n    which are indistinguishable from genuine ability gain in binary responses. Min\n    detectable contamination is 55-80% depending on benchmark — far above realistic\n    contamination scenarios. This establishes the detection frontier lower bound for\n    binary-only methods.\n\n    '\n- name: Leaderboard-Scale Audit (Open LLM Leaderboard v1)\n  plan_id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n  description: '对 Open LLM Leaderboard v1 的 13K+ 模型计算 per-benchmark person-fit statistics。\n    大规模 psychometric profiling: ability distribution, misfit typology, temporal trends。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_processed: 5847\n    n_models_excluded_missing_data: 3200\n    n_models_excluded_too_few_items: 1500\n    n_models_excluded_parse_errors: 2453\n    benchmarks_analyzed:\n    - MMLU\n    - HellaSwag\n    - ARC-Challenge\n    - GSM8K\n    pct_models_flagged_mmlu: 96.2\n    pct_models_flagged_hellaswag: 94.8\n    pct_models_flagged_arc_c: 88.5\n    pct_models_flagged_gsm8k: 91.3\n    pct_models_flagged_any_benchmark: 98.7\n    pct_models_flagged_all_benchmarks: 82.4\n    lz_star_median_mmlu: -22.4\n    lz_star_median_hellaswag: -18.1\n    lz_star_iqr_mmlu: 15.3\n    lz_star_iqr_hellaswag: 12.8\n    theta_mean_mmlu: 0.28\n    theta_std_mmlu: 0.31\n    theta_median_mmlu: 0.22\n    theta_skewness_mmlu: 0.85\n    mean_accuracy_trend_slope_per_month_mmlu: 0.0042\n    mean_lz_star_trend_slope_per_month_mmlu: -0.38\n    n_clusters_identified: 4\n    cluster_labels:\n    - Low-ability consistent\n    - Mid-ability aberrant-negative\n    - High-ability aberrant-positive\n    - Extreme-ability over-consistent\n    cluster_sizes:\n    - 2104\n    - 1876\n    - 1298\n    - 569\n    cross_benchmark_spearman_lz_significant_frac: 0.12\n    n_models_flagged_extreme_positive_lz_any: 312\n    n_models_flagged_extreme_positive_lz_multiple: 47\n    top_anomalous_models_count: 15\n    gemini15_in_dataset: false\n  result_rationale: '数据处理是主要瓶颈：13K+ 模型中约 45% 因数据质量问题（items 缺失、格式异常、重复提交）被排除， 最终 ~5800\n    模型可用。这仍远超任何现有 person-fit 研究的规模。 Universal misfit 在大规模下得到压倒性确认：96-99% 模型被 flagged。但这恰恰是问题——\n    当几乎所有模型都被 flag 时，person-fit 无法区分 contaminated 和 clean 模型。 Temporal trend 显示 mean\n    accuracy 随时间上升（能力通胀），同时 lz* 变得更极端（misfit 加剧）， 这与 SFT 泛化假设一致：更强的 SFT 技术 → 更大的 4PL\n    violation。 4 类 response pattern typology 是 Angle B 的核心 contribution， 但无法从 typology\n    中可靠识别 contamination——\"aberrant-positive\" cluster 包含真正高能力模型和可能被污染的模型， binary responses\n    无法区分。 Cross-benchmark consistency 很弱（12% significant），进一步证明 lz* 不是 contamination\n    的可靠指标， 而是模型-benchmark interaction 的复杂函数。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Universal Misfit at Leaderboard Scale'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - n_models\n    - '% flagged (|lz*|>3)'\n    - median lz*\n    - IQR\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - '5847'\n      - 96.2%\n      - '-22.4'\n      - '15.3'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - '5612'\n      - 94.8%\n      - '-18.1'\n      - '12.8'\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - '5234'\n      - 88.5%\n      - '-8.7'\n      - '7.2'\n    - - GSM8K\n      - '4891'\n      - 91.3%\n      - '-11.5'\n      - '9.4'\n  - name: 'Table: Response Pattern Typology (K-means, k=4)'\n    columns:\n    - Cluster\n    - n_models\n    - θ range\n    - lz* range\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Low-ability consistent\n      - '2104'\n      - '[-0.5, 0.1]'\n      - '[-8, -2]'\n      - Weak models, mild misfit\n    - - Mid-ability aberrant-neg\n      - '1876'\n      - '[0.1, 0.5]'\n      - '[-35, -10]'\n      - Strong negative aberrance\n    - - High-ability aberrant-pos\n      - '1298'\n      - '[0.5, 1.0]'\n      - '[-15, +5]'\n      - Mixed misfit direction\n    - - Extreme over-consistent\n      - '569'\n      - '[0.8, 2.5]'\n      - '[+5, +40]'\n      - Possible contamination OR genuine expertise\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot θ vs lz* for ~5800 models on MMLU, colored by cluster. 4 distinct\n    regions visible. Overlay: theoretical null band (±1.96) contains <4% of points.'\n  - 'Fig: Temporal trend — monthly median lz* (MMLU) from 2023-06 to 2024-12. Downward\n    trend (more extreme misfit over time) with 95% CI band.'\n  - 'Fig: Histogram of lz* values across all models×benchmarks (~22K data points).\n    Extremely heavy tails compared to N(0,1) overlay. Quantifies universal misfit\n    magnitude.'\n  analysis: 'Leaderboard audit 成为 Angle B 的核心 empirical contribution。5800+ 模型的 psychometric\n    profiling 在规模上无人匹及。但 detection 层面完全失败：当 96% 模型都被 flag 时，person-fit 失去了区分力。 Typology\n    中 \"extreme over-consistent\" cluster (569 models) 理论上最可能包含 contaminated 模型， 但无法验证（没有\n    ground truth）。这恰好呼应 Angle A：binary responses 信息不足以做可靠区分。 Temporal trend 是有趣的附带发现：模型能力提升的同时\n    4PL misfit 加剧，暗示 LLM 的进步方式 与经典 test-taker 的进步方式根本不同。\n\n    '\n- name: 4PL vs 3PL Ablation\n  plan_id: exp-4pl-ablation\n  description: '比较 4PL (with feasibility parameter d) 和 3PL (fixed d=1) 下的检测灵敏度差异。\n    在 simulation 和 real data 两个层面评估。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    sim_power_4pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.978\n    sim_power_3pl_mmlu_15pct: 0.965\n    sim_power_diff_mmlu_15pct: -0.013\n    sim_power_4pl_hellaswag_15pct: 0.753\n    sim_power_3pl_hellaswag_15pct: 0.741\n    flagged_rate_4pl: 0.95\n    flagged_rate_3pl: 0.933\n    lz_star_correlation_4pl_3pl: 0.987\n    mean_abs_lz_diff: 0.42\n    delta_lz_cohen_d_4pl_15pct_mmlu: 0.24\n    delta_lz_cohen_d_3pl_15pct_mmlu: 0.21\n    detection_improvement_from_d: negligible\n  result_rationale: '4PL 的 feasibility parameter d 控制 high-ability examinees 在极难 items\n    上的 ceiling。 在经典 IRT 中，d<1 表示即使最强考生也不一定能答对最难题目，这对 LLM 很相关 （LLM 在某些极难 items 上确实表现不佳）。但\n    d 参数对 person-fit detection 的影响很小： lz* 主要由 response pattern 的整体一致性驱动，而非单个 item\n    的 upper asymptote 建模。 4PL 和 3PL 的 lz* 高度相关（r=0.987），difference 不超过 0.5 个单位。 在\n    worst 档下，这个差异更加无关紧要——当 Δlz* 本身接近 noise floor 时， item model 的微调不可能拯救 detection。结论：d\n    parameter 不是检测力不足的原因。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: 4PL vs 3PL Detection Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Setting\n    - Metric\n    - 4PL\n    - 3PL (d=1)\n    - Diff\n    rows:\n    - - Simulation\n      - Power@15% MMLU\n      - '0.978'\n      - '0.965'\n      - '-0.013'\n    - - Simulation\n      - Power@15% HellaSwag\n      - '0.753'\n      - '0.741'\n      - '-0.012'\n    - - Real data\n      - Flag rate (12 models)\n      - 95.0%\n      - 93.3%\n      - -1.7pp\n    - - Controlled\n      - Cohen's d@15% MMLU\n      - '0.24'\n      - '0.21'\n      - '-0.03'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Scatter plot lz*(4PL) vs lz*(3PL) for 60 (model, benchmark) cells. Near-perfect\n    diagonal (r=0.987). Deviation from diagonal annotated for outlier cells.'\n  analysis: 'Ablation 排除了 \"wrong IRT model\" 作为检测失败的解释。4PL vs 3PL 几乎不影响结果， 说明问题不在 item\n    model specification 而在更根本的层面——binary response 的信息量。 这支持 Angle A 的 information-theoretic\n    framing。\n\n    '\n- name: Baseline Comparison (IRT-FIT vs ConStat vs Min-K%++)\n  plan_id: exp-baseline-comparison\n  description: '在控制实验的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，比较 IRT-FIT vs gray-box baselines\n    的 AUROC 和 Type-I error。量化 minimal-information operating point 的代价。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    auroc_irt_fit_15pct_mmlu: 0.61\n    auroc_constat_15pct_mmlu: 0.89\n    auroc_minkpp_15pct_mmlu: 0.93\n    auroc_gap_vs_best_15pct: -0.32\n    auroc_irt_fit_50pct_mmlu: 0.78\n    auroc_constat_50pct_mmlu: 0.96\n    auroc_minkpp_50pct_mmlu: 0.98\n    auroc_gap_vs_best_50pct: -0.2\n    type1_irt_fit: 0.08\n    type1_constat: 0.04\n    type1_minkpp: 0.03\n    mean_auroc_irt_fit_15pct: 0.57\n    mean_auroc_constat_15pct: 0.86\n    mean_auroc_minkpp_15pct: 0.91\n    irt_fit_info_level: binary responses only\n    constat_info_level: binary responses + rephrased re-test\n    minkpp_info_level: token-level log-probabilities\n  result_rationale: '这是 worst 档最痛的结果：IRT-FIT 的 AUROC 与 baselines 差距 >30pp。 ConStat\n    通过 rephrased re-test 获得了 IRT-FIT 无法获取的关键信息—— 如果模型记住了特定 item 的答案，换个说法后就答不出来，这种\n    inconsistency 在 binary response 层面可检测。 Min-K%++ 直接访问 token log-probabilities，能区分\n    \"seen in training\"（low perplexity on exact tokens） 和 \"genuinely knows\"（reasonable\n    perplexity, correct reasoning）。 IRT-FIT 只有 binary correct/incorrect，根本没有这些信息。\n    但 Type-I error 略高（0.08 vs 0.03-0.04）也值得注意——universal misfit 导致 false alarm 偏多，\n    进一步削弱 practical utility。 关键 spin：这个 gap 不是 IRT-FIT 方法的 failure，而是 binary response\n    这个 information level 的 fundamental limitation。所有 binary-only 方法都会面临同样的 ceiling。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Detection Frontier — AUROC by Method and Information Level'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Info Level\n    - AUROC@15%\n    - AUROC@50%\n    - Type-I (α=0.05)\n    rows:\n    - - IRT-FIT (ours)\n      - Binary responses\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.08'\n    - - ConStat\n      - Binary + re-test\n      - '0.89'\n      - '0.96'\n      - '0.04'\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - Token log-probs\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.98'\n      - '0.03'\n  - name: 'Table: AUROC by Benchmark (15% contamination)'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - MMLU\n    - HellaSwag\n    - GSM8K\n    - Mean\n    rows:\n    - - IRT-FIT\n      - '0.61'\n      - '0.58'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.58'\n    - - ConStat\n      - '0.89'\n      - '0.85'\n      - '0.83'\n      - '0.86'\n    - - Min-K%++\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.91'\n      - '0.88'\n      - '0.91'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Detection frontier diagram. X-axis = information access level (binary →\n    re-test → log-probs → weights → training data). Y-axis = AUROC at 15% contamination.\n    IRT-FIT at bottom-left, other methods along the frontier. Shaded region below\n    IRT-FIT labeled ''binary-only ceiling''.'\n  - 'Fig: ROC curves for 3 methods on MMLU at 15% contamination. IRT-FIT curve barely\n    above diagonal, ConStat and Min-K%++ clearly separated.'\n  analysis: 'Baseline comparison 是 Angle A 的 empirical backbone。30pp+ AUROC gap 直接量化了\n    binary-only operating point 的代价。但 narrative spin 至关重要： 这不是 \"our method is worse\"，而是\n    \"we establish the floor — ANY binary-only method will hit this ceiling, and we\n    prove it theoretically (simulation) and empirically (controlled exp).\" Detection\n    frontier diagram 将成为论文的 signature figure。\n\n    '\n- name: Multiscale lzm Cross-Benchmark Aggregation\n  plan_id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n  description: '实现 Hong, Lin & Cheng (2021) 的 multiscale lzm 统计量， 跨 benchmark 聚合标准化\n    lz* 提供 model-level 整体污染指标。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_phase_b: 12\n    lzm_mean: -14.8\n    lzm_std: 8.3\n    lzm_min: -31.2\n    lzm_max: 2.1\n    pct_significant_lzm: 91.7\n    lzm_improvement_over_best_single_benchmark_auroc: 0.02\n    lzm_correlation_with_mean_lz_star: 0.96\n    lzm_auroc_15pct: 0.63\n    lzm_auroc_50pct: 0.8\n    lzm_improvement_over_single_benchmark_15pct: 0.02\n  result_rationale: 'Multiscale aggregation 在 worst 档下几乎无帮助。理论上，如果 contamination 只影响特定\n    benchmark， 跨 benchmark 聚合应该通过 \"pooling signals\" 提高 detection power。但 worst 档的问题不是\n    signal 分散在多个 benchmark——而是每个 benchmark 上的 signal 本身就很弱。 Aggregating weak signals\n    ≈ aggregating noise。lzm 与 mean lz* 高度相关（r=0.96）， 说明聚合没有提取到新信息。AUROC 仅提升 2pp（0.61→0.63\n    at 15%），统计上不显著。 在 Phase B 12 模型上，91.7% 被 flagged——与单 benchmark 结果一致，universal\n    misfit 在聚合后依然主导。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: lzm Results (Phase B, 12 models)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - lzm\n    - p-value\n    - Flagged?\n    rows:\n    - - Gemini-1.5-Pro\n      - '-31.2'\n      - <0.001\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - GPT-4o\n      - '-22.7'\n      - <0.001\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - Claude-3.5-Sonnet\n      - '-19.4'\n      - <0.001\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - '...(9 more)'\n      - '...'\n      - '...'\n      - 10 Yes, 1 No\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart of lzm by model (Phase B), sorted. Nearly all bars exceed significance\n    threshold. Single unflagged model annotated.'\n  analysis: 'lzm 不是 rescue path。当 individual signals 都是 noise 时，sophisticated aggregation\n    无法创造 signal。 但 lzm 可以作为 Angle B 的 supplementary metric——universal misfit 在 multiscale\n    聚合下仍然 dominant， 这 strengthens \"LLMs are fundamentally different from test-takers\"\n    的 claim。\n\n    '\n- name: Post-RL Signal Retention\n  plan_id: exp-post-rl\n  description: 'Qwen3.5-9B: SFT 污染 (15%/50% MMLU) → GRPO RL training → 测量 lz* signal\n    retention。 回应 Wang et al. (2025) 关于 MIA methods 在 post-RL 失效的问题。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    lz_star_pre_rl_15pct: -17.1\n    lz_star_pre_rl_50pct: -14.6\n    delta_lz_pre_rl_15pct: 1.3\n    delta_lz_pre_rl_50pct: 3.8\n    lz_star_post_rl_15pct: -19.8\n    lz_star_post_rl_50pct: -17.4\n    delta_lz_post_rl_15pct: -0.2\n    delta_lz_post_rl_50pct: 0.7\n    signal_retention_15pct: 0.0\n    signal_retention_50pct: 0.03\n    post_rl_accuracy_change_mmlu_15pct: -0.008\n    post_rl_accuracy_change_mmlu_50pct: -0.012\n    rl_method: GRPO\n    rl_reward: rule-based (GSM8K format correctness + MATH answer match)\n    rl_steps: 2000\n    rl_epochs: 1\n  result_rationale: 'Post-RL signal retention 接近 0 是 worst 档的 defining prediction。\n    RL（特别是 GRPO）通过 reward shaping 重新优化模型的 response distribution， 这个过程 effectively\n    \"forgets\" the specific item-level patterns that SFT might have created。 (1) RL\n    优化的是 reward signal 而非 specific item responses，所以 SFT 阶段可能存在的 item-level memorization\n    被 RL 的 exploration/exploitation 动态稀释。 (2) 在 worst 档，SFT contamination signal 本身就很弱（Δlz*\n    at 15% = 1.3, p=0.38）， RL 只需要极小的 perturbation 就能完全消除。 (3) 即使 50% 污染（Δlz* = 3.8），RL\n    后 retention 也只有 3%（Δlz* 从 3.8 降到 0.7）， 几乎完全不可检测。 (4) 有趣的是 accuracy 在 RL 后略微下降（-0.8pp\n    to -1.2pp）， 说明 RL reward signal（GSM8K/MATH）与 MMLU 不完全 aligned， RL 牺牲了少量 MMLU 能力来获取\n    math reasoning 能力。 这与 Wang et al. (2025) 的结论一致：post-RL contamination 对所有 detection\n    methods 都是严峻挑战。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Post-RL Signal Retention'\n    columns:\n    - Contam %\n    - Δlz* pre-RL\n    - Δlz* post-RL\n    - Retention\n    - Acc Δ post-RL\n    rows:\n    - - 15%\n      - '+1.3'\n      - '-0.2'\n      - 0%\n      - -0.8pp\n    - - 50%\n      - '+3.8'\n      - '+0.7'\n      - 3%\n      - -1.2pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Bar chart showing Δlz* before and after RL for 15% and 50% contamination.\n    Pre-RL bars already small; post-RL bars essentially zero. Annotated with Wang\n    et al. (2025) MIA results for comparison.'\n  analysis: 'Post-RL 实验在 worst 档下结果完全消极但有很强的 narrative value： 它证明 binary-only detection\n    不仅在 SFT 阶段就很弱，在 realistic training pipeline（SFT → RL）下 完全失效。这 strengthens Angle\n    A 的 \"fundamental information bottleneck\" claim。 对比 Wang et al.：他们证明 token-level\n    MIA 在 post-RL 失效；我们证明 binary-level person-fit 在 post-RL 更彻底地失效——因为 binary 信息量更少。\n\n    '\n- name: Extra Benchmarks (BBH, MATH) Power Analysis\n  plan_id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n  description: '在 BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 上运行 simulation power analysis，\n    填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap，验证理论 power function。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bbh_n_items: 6511\n    bbh_sim_power_15pct_one_sided: 0.842\n    bbh_sim_power_15pct_two_sided: 0.871\n    bbh_sim_power_50pct_two_sided: 0.924\n    bbh_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.855\n    bbh_theory_vs_sim_rmse: 0.02\n    math_n_items: 5000\n    math_sim_power_15pct_one_sided: 0.721\n    math_sim_power_15pct_two_sided: 0.758\n    math_sim_power_50pct_two_sided: 0.889\n    math_theoretical_power_15pct: 0.74\n    math_theory_vs_sim_rmse: 0.03\n    combined_R2_with_original_benchmarks: 0.963\n    sqrt_n_scaling_confirmed: true\n    predicted_ctrl_auroc_bbh_15pct: 0.57\n    predicted_ctrl_auroc_math_15pct: 0.55\n  result_rationale: 'BBH 和 MATH 填补了 GSM8K (1.3K) 和 MMLU (14K) 之间的 gap，在 simulation\n    中表现符合预期： power ∝ √n_items，BBH (6.5K) 的 power 介于 GSM8K 和 HellaSwag 之间。 理论 power\n    function（exp-power-theory）的预测与新 simulation 结果吻合（R² = 0.963）， 证明 √n scaling law\n    在更广 item range 上成立。 但 worst 档的关键点是：这些 simulation power numbers 在 real SFT 下毫无意义。\n    即使 BBH simulation power = 87%，predicted controlled AUROC 仍然只有 0.57。 Simulation-reality\n    gap 与 benchmark 大小无关——它由 SFT 泛化驱动，而非 statistical power。 这进一步支持 \"information bottleneck,\n    not power bottleneck\" 的 narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Simulation Power for Extended Benchmarks'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - n_items\n    - Sim Power @15%\n    - Theory @15%\n    - Predicted Real AUROC @15%\n    rows:\n    - - GSM8K\n      - '1319'\n      - '0.591'\n      - '0.573'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - MATH\n      - '5000'\n      - '0.758'\n      - '0.740'\n      - '0.55'\n    - - BBH\n      - '6511'\n      - '0.871'\n      - '0.855'\n      - '0.57'\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - '10042'\n      - '0.753'\n      - '0.765'\n      - '0.58'\n    - - MMLU\n      - '14042'\n      - '0.978'\n      - '0.979'\n      - '0.61'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Power vs n_items plot with original 5 benchmarks (circles) + BBH, MATH (triangles).\n    Theoretical curve (solid line) fits well. Secondary y-axis or inset shows predicted\n    real AUROC (flat near 0.55-0.61), illustrating that simulation power ≠ real detection\n    ability.'\n  analysis: 'Extra benchmarks 完成了 Claim 2 的 simulation-side story：power function 理论验证成功。\n    但在 worst 档下，这个 success 被 recontextualized 为 \"the theory works perfectly WITHIN\n    the 4PL model; the problem is that real SFT data violates 4PL in ways that destroy\n    detection power regardless of n_items.\" The decoupling of simulation power from\n    real detection ability is itself a key finding.\n\n    '\n- name: MMLU Domain-Level Analysis\n  plan_id: exp-domain-analysis\n  description: '按 MMLU subject category 分别计算 person-fit，分析 misfit 的 domain-specific\n    structure。 探测 Gemini-1.5 的 MMLU 污染模式。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_domains: 57\n    n_supercategories: 4\n    pct_domains_flagged_gemini15: 100.0\n    pct_domains_flagged_median_model: 89.5\n    domain_lz_star_variance_across_domains: 8.7\n    gemini15_lz_star_stem: 8.2\n    gemini15_lz_star_humanities: 7.4\n    gemini15_lz_star_social_science: 6.9\n    gemini15_lz_star_other: 5.8\n    domain_delta_lz_cv_15pct: 1.35\n    n_domains_with_significant_delta_lz_15pct: 0\n    n_domains_with_significant_delta_lz_50pct: 3\n    domain_lz_star_icc: 0.72\n  result_rationale: 'Domain-level 分析在 worst 档下有两个发现： (1) Universal misfit 是 universal——Gemini-1.5\n    在所有 57 个 MMLU domain 上都被 flagged， 不存在 \"clean domains\" 和 \"contaminated domains\"\n    的区分。其他模型类似，median 模型 90% domains 被 flagged。 这排除了 \"contamination is domain-specific\"\n    的假设——misfit 是 global LLM property。 (2) 在控制实验中，domain-level Δlz* 的 cross-domain\n    CV = 1.35（极高）， 说明污染 signal 在 domain 间分布极不均匀且方向不一致。15% 污染时没有任何 single domain 达到显著，\n    50% 时仅 3/57 domains 显著——因为每个 domain 只有 ~50-300 items，统计 power 极低。 Domain-level\n    分析无法 rescue detection，但支持 \"item count is key\" 的理论。 Gemini-1.5 跨 supercategory\n    的 lz* 分布（STEM > Humanities > Social Science > Other） 可能反映模型架构对不同知识类型的编码方式差异，而非污染模式——这是\n    Angle B 的 supplementary finding。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table: Gemini-1.5 MMLU Domain-Level lz* by Supercategory'\n    columns:\n    - Supercategory\n    - n_domains\n    - mean lz*\n    - min lz*\n    - max lz*\n    - '% flagged'\n    rows:\n    - - STEM\n      - '18'\n      - '8.2'\n      - '2.1'\n      - '15.3'\n      - 100%\n    - - Humanities\n      - '13'\n      - '7.4'\n      - '1.8'\n      - '12.7'\n      - 100%\n    - - Social Science\n      - '12'\n      - '6.9'\n      - '1.5'\n      - '11.4'\n      - 100%\n    - - Other\n      - '14'\n      - '5.8'\n      - '0.9'\n      - '10.2'\n      - 100%\n  - name: 'Table: Domain-Level Δlz* in Controlled Experiment (MMLU, 4-model avg)'\n    columns:\n    - Contam %\n    - Domains significant (p<0.05)\n    - Domain Δlz* CV\n    - Max domain Cohen's d\n    rows:\n    - - 15%\n      - 0 / 57\n      - '1.35'\n      - '0.41'\n    - - 50%\n      - 3 / 57\n      - '0.98'\n      - '0.72'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig: Heatmap of lz* across 12 models × 57 MMLU domains. Nearly all cells extreme\n    (dark red/blue). Pattern: model-driven rows rather than domain-driven columns.'\n  - 'Fig: Domain-level Δlz* distribution (box plot) at 15% and 50% contamination.\n    15%: boxes centered near 0 with wide spread. 50%: slight positive shift but high\n    variance.'\n  analysis: Domain analysis 确认 misfit 是 model-level phenomenon 而非 domain-specific。\n    这支持 Angle B 的 \"LLM response patterns are globally different from test-taker patterns\"\n    论点。 同时否定了 \"domain-specific contamination detection\" 作为 rescue strategy。 在 paper\n    中定位为 Angle B 的 supplementary evidence。\n","numLines":865,"startLine":1,"totalLines":865}}}
